Tornado flipbook (T_TornadoFlipbook.png, tornado_flipbook.json)

Baked by scripts/bake_tornado_flipbook.py (Blender, offline) from:

  JangaFX EmberGen free VDB animations: "Tornado Looping"
  https://jangafx.com/software/embergen/download/free-vdb-animations
  Author: JangaFX

  Licence: CC0 1.0 Universal (Public Domain Dedication), as stated on the page above.
  https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

  The render machine confirms the licence on the download page before the bake and
  records the downloaded zip's sha256 in PIN.json (source_zip_sha256). The raw VDB is
  not in this repository; only the baked atlas and its JSON are.

Credit to JangaFX is courtesy, not a requirement of CC0.
